  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Aura</strong> faint Fallen Fey; <strong>CL</strong> 5th<br>\n<strong>Slot</strong> none; <strong>Price</strong> 1,000 gp; <strong>Weight</strong> 0.1 lbs.</p>\n<p><strong>Description</strong><br>\nYou are treated as a fey and no longer count as your previous creature type for all purposes including spells, magic items, etc., but you do not gain any of the benefits of the fey type or lose the benefits of your previous creature type, and still possess any subtypes you previously possessed (thus, an elf using this ability would be treated as a fey with the elf subtype). In addition, you gain a +2 bonus to all Charisma-based skill and ability checks. These effects last for 5 hours.</p>\n<p><strong>Construction Requirements</strong><br>\nDistill Compound, Fallen Fey sphere (Fey Beauty); <strong>Cost</strong> 500 gp</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/compounds#toc110\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
